WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
Instrument the pilot at run level.
Capture mode, scope, raw result,

00:00:04.366 --> 00:00:07.840
review time, model cost and rerun count.

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:12.160
Compare conventional and assisted work
under the same environment and acceptance

00:00:12.213 --> 00:00:16.880
rules. Include unsuccessful attempts,
correction and operation.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:21.120
Keep setup separate from recurring effort,
and report quality alongside speed.

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:26.240
This slide defines a proposed
measurement schema; no pilot observations

00:00:26.256 --> 00:00:30.960
have been recorded. Generated-test volume
does not establish headcount savings.
